gxde-kwin-x11 (4:6.7.6-17) unstable; urgency=medium

  * Restore the epoch; 6.7.6-2 sorted below the 4:6.7.6-16 in the archive.
  * Port deepin-kwin's chameleon decoration to KDecoration 3 and use it by
    default. Announce _DEEPIN_CHAMELEON, _DEEPIN_NO_TITLEBAR and
    _DEEPIN_FORCE_DECORATE so that DTK windows use dxcb's no-titlebar mode.
  * Rounded windows through KDecoration 3, following DTK/WindowRadius and
    the per-window theme dxcb publishes. Ship GXDE's chameleon theme values.
  * Replace the deepin-wm-dbus of the KWin 5 window manager when it holds
    com.deepin.wm in a gxde-kwin_x11 session.
  * Add gxde-x11-exp-session as a transitional package for
    gxde-experimental-x11-session.

